On casting Entropic Gift, a radius 1 rift in spacetime will be opened underneath the target for [2, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns, increasing in radius by 1 each turn to a maximum of [0, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)].

All caught within the rift are pulled towards the center and take [9.87, 13, 16, 18, 20 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness and [9.87, 13, 16, 18, 20 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage, plus [5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)] of your total entropy each turn (currently 0).
